# UR Cutter vs Alurentell. Part C: Tomb of Annihilation, Atraxa, Omniscience free casts, Acererak attack.

=== acererak-tomb-completed-stays
title: Acererak with Aluren through Tomb of Annihilation: Trapped Entry -> Veils of Fear -> Sandfall Cell -> Cradle of the Death God; after completion Acererak stays on the battlefield
ref: Acererak Oracle ("if you haven't completed Tomb of Annihilation"); CR 701.49, 309.7; Tomb room text
state:
  humanhand=Acererak the Archlich
  humanbattlefield=Aluren
script:
  p1: cast Acererak the Archlich ~free
  p1: pick Tomb of Annihilation
  p1: wait-empty
  p1: cast Acererak the Archlich ~free
  p1: pick Veils of Fear
  p1: pick no
  p1: wait-empty
  p1: cast Acererak the Archlich ~free
  p1: wait-empty
  p1: cast Acererak the Archlich ~free
  p1: wait-empty
  p1: cast Acererak the Archlich ~free
  p1: wait-empty
expect:
  zone p1 battlefield has "Acererak the Archlich"
  zone p1 battlefield has "The Atropal"

=== acererak-attack-zombie-unless-sacrifice
title: Acererak attacks: the opponent makes a 2/2 Zombie for you unless they sacrifice a creature
ref: Acererak Oracle
state:
  humanbattlefield=Acererak the Archlich
  aibattlefield=Goblin Bombardment
script:
  p1: at COMBAT_BEGIN
  p1: attack Acererak the Archlich
  p1: at MAIN2
expect:
  zone p1 battlefield has "Zombie Token"
  life p2 == 15

=== atraxa-reveal-ten-one-of-each-type
title: Atraxa: reveal ten, put one card of each type into hand (creature, land, artifact, enchantment, instant, sorcery), rest on the bottom
ref: Atraxa, Grand Unifier Oracle
state:
  humanhand=Atraxa, Grand Unifier
  humanmanapool=G W U B C C C
  humanlibrary=Island;Brainstorm;Stock Up;Lotus Petal;Aluren;Acererak the Archlich;Ancient Tomb;Force of Will;Ponder;Mishra's Bauble;Boseiju, Who Endures;Show and Tell
script:
  p1: cast Atraxa, Grand Unifier
expect:
  zone p1 hand size == 6
  zone p1 library size == 6

=== atraxa-reveal-ten-library-shorter
title: Atraxa with fewer than ten cards in library reveals all of them
ref: Atraxa, Grand Unifier Oracle
state:
  humanhand=Atraxa, Grand Unifier
  humanmanapool=G W U B C C C
  humanlibrary=Brainstorm;Stock Up;Island
script:
  p1: cast Atraxa, Grand Unifier
expect:
  zone p1 hand size == 3
  zone p1 library size == 0

=== atraxa-keywords
title: Atraxa: flying, vigilance, deathtouch, lifelink combat (blocks and gains life from damage dealt)
ref: Atraxa Oracle; CR 702.15 (lifelink), 702.2 (deathtouch)
state:
  humanbattlefield=Atraxa, Grand Unifier
  aibattlefield=Murktide Regent
  aihand=Lightning Bolt
  activeplayer=p2
  activephase=MAIN1
script:
  p2: at COMBAT_BEGIN
  p2: attack Murktide Regent
  p1: block Atraxa, Grand Unifier blocks Murktide Regent
  p2: at p2:MAIN2
expect:
  zone p2 graveyard has "Murktide Regent"
  life p1 == 27
  zone p1 battlefield has "Atraxa, Grand Unifier"

=== omniscience-free-cast-from-hand
title: Omniscience: Atraxa cast from hand without paying its mana cost; no mana spent
ref: Omniscience Oracle
state:
  humanhand=Atraxa, Grand Unifier
  humanbattlefield=Omniscience
script:
  p1: cast Atraxa, Grand Unifier ~free
expect:
  zone p1 battlefield has "Atraxa, Grand Unifier"
  life p1 == 20

=== omniscience-free-force-of-will-no-pitch
title: Omniscience: Force of Will cast for free from hand counters a spell with no life paid and no card exiled
ref: Omniscience Oracle
state:
  humanbattlefield=Omniscience
  humanhand=Force of Will;Brainstorm
  aihand=Lightning Bolt
  aibattlefield=Mountain
  activeplayer=p2
script:
  p2: cast Lightning Bolt -> p1
  p2: pass
  p1: when-stack Lightning Bolt
  p1: cast Force of Will ~free -> Lightning Bolt
expect:
  life p1 == 20
  zone p1 hand has "Brainstorm"
  zone p1 exile size == 0
  zone p2 graveyard has "Lightning Bolt"

=== omniscience-not-instant-speed-for-creatures
title: Omniscience does not grant flash: Atraxa cannot be cast for free on the opponent's turn
ref: Omniscience Oracle; CR 307.1 / 601.3 (creatures are sorcery speed)
state:
  activeplayer=p2
  activephase=UPKEEP
  humanbattlefield=Omniscience
  humanhand=Atraxa, Grand Unifier
script:
  p1: at p2:UPKEEP
  p1: try cast Atraxa, Grand Unifier ~free
expect:
  zone p1 hand has "Atraxa, Grand Unifier"

=== omniscience-and-aluren-both
title: With Omniscience and Aluren, a creature spell (MV 3) can be cast free at instant speed (Aluren) while Atraxa (MV 7) only at sorcery speed (Omniscience)
ref: Omniscience, Aluren Oracle
state:
  activeplayer=p2
  activephase=UPKEEP
  humanbattlefield=Omniscience;Aluren
  humanhand=Atraxa, Grand Unifier;Acererak the Archlich
script:
  p1: at p2:UPKEEP
  p1: try cast Atraxa, Grand Unifier ~free
  p1: cast Acererak the Archlich ~free
  p1: pick Lost Mine of Phandelver
expect:
  zone p1 hand has "Atraxa, Grand Unifier"
  spells p1 == 1
